WEBVTT

00:02:25.057 --> 00:02:30.229
by movement of the body and mind
to take control over their lives.

00:02:31.689 --> 00:02:33.733
So how I did that.

00:02:35.067 --> 00:02:39.572
I wanted to prove to the world
that I can face my demons.

00:02:40.615 --> 00:02:44.785
And not just for one,
but 230 continuous days.

00:02:44.827 --> 00:02:49.790
So I decided to walk
across the length of India

00:02:49.832 --> 00:02:52.627
from the very south to the north,

00:02:52.668 --> 00:02:55.671
a distance of 2,300 miles.

00:02:55.713 --> 00:02:57.340
(Applause)

00:02:58.716 --> 00:03:01.844
2,300 miles. How much is that?